conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.1966945Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2064236Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2075023Z ^[[0m
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2075802Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2076680Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2077181Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2077476Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2078169Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2079127Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2079510Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2080095Z    if you are ready to continue.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2080497Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2081106Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2082170Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2082875Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2083405Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2083712Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2083932Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2084402Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2084941Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2085538Z    can use Nix.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2085750Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2086040Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2086304Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2086831Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2087487Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2087996Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2088221Z I will:
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2088439Z 
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2088696Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2089394Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2089979Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2090490Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2091053Z  - install Nix in /nix
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2091467Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2091969Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2093055Z    /root
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2103001Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2103841Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2115124Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2115849Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
conformance-relock (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:52:40.2116422Z 
