conformance-external (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:21.1444626Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
conformance-external (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:21.1452703Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
conformance-external (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:21.1453343Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
conformance-external (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:21.1453688Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
conformance-external (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T02:54:21.1453853Z 
